<!--
  The ForgeShape mark: a solid block with its front corner cut away.

  It says what the program makes — solids you shape by adding and removing
  material — before the user has made anything. The cut's floor is filled:
  it is the face the cut produced, the "hot" part of the forge. Drawn on the
  same 24-unit grid as every other icon, white and tinted at use, so it
  belongs to the set. The launcher icon (ic_launcher_*) is the same geometry
  in colour.
-->
